flowchart TD
    C[HTTP Client] -->|X-API-Key when AUTH_ENABLED| A[Go API]
    A -->|validate URL: SSRF/redirect policy| OP[Outbound Policy]
    A -->|event + outbox, one transaction| DB[(PostgreSQL)]

    OR[Outbox Relay] -->|poll unpublished rows| DB
    OR -->|XADD| RS[(Redis Stream)]

    RSc[Retry Scheduler] -->|due retry + outbox, one transaction| DB
    RSc -->|reconcile stale unleased transport work| DB

    RS -->|XREADGROUP| WP[Worker Pool]
    WP -->|re-check status and claim fenced delivery lease| DB
    WP -->|CircuitAllow / RecordCircuitOutcome| DB
    WP -->|validate again at dial time| OP
    WP --> DC[Delivery Client]
    DC -->|POST + stable key + optional timestamped HMAC| T[Webhook Target /\ninternal/targetsim]

    WP -->|record attempt + transition| DB
    WP -->|XAUTOCLAIM: recover crashed worker's pending messages| RS

    A --> M[/metrics Prometheus registry/]
    WP --> M
    OR --> M
    M --> P[Prometheus]
    P --> G[Grafana]

    classDef durable fill:#e8f4ff,stroke:#2a6bb0
    classDef transport fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#b07a2a
    class DB durable
    class RS transport
